WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.550
Oliver was playing minigolf for the first time.

2
00:00:07.551 --> 00:00:11.075
"I'll help you," Dad said.

3
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:15.496
He showed Oliver how to hold the club.

4
00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:21.199
Oliver looked around. "Where's the hole?"

5
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.884
Mom pointed. "Over the bridge."

6
00:00:26.885 --> 00:00:31.082
Oliver's ball reached the middle of the bridge.

7
00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:33.822
It rolled back.

8
00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:44.976
"Oops!" Oliver tried again—and again.

9
00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:50.616
Harry sighed. "We'll be here forever."

10
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.556
"No," Dad said.

11
00:00:53.557 --> 00:01:01.735
"You can only swing six times at each hole."

12
00:01:01.736 --> 00:01:05.788
Oliver had trouble at every hole.

13
00:01:05.789 --> 00:01:16.751
His ball didn't go through the dinosaur's legs.

14
00:01:16.752 --> 00:01:27.018
It bounced off the windmill.

15
00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:31.051
Then he hit Emmy's ball.

16
00:01:31.052 --> 00:01:37.182
It landed in the pond. Splash!

17
00:01:37.183 --> 00:01:44.475
"Oliver!" Mom called. "Don't go in the pond!"

18
00:01:44.476 --> 00:01:49.111
But Oliver was already in the water.

19
00:01:49.112 --> 00:01:54.174
"Got it!" He held up Emmy's ball.

20
00:01:54.175 --> 00:01:59.222
Oliver fell climbing out of the pond.

21
00:01:59.223 --> 00:02:03.925
His legs were wet and muddy.

22
00:02:03.926 --> 00:02:07.175
Oliver sat down on the green.

23
00:02:07.176 --> 00:02:11.358
"I hate this game!"

24
00:02:11.359 --> 00:02:15.665
"Everybody has trouble at first," Mom said.

25
00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:20.903
"Nobody has this much trouble," Harry whispered.

26
00:02:20.904 --> 00:02:25.874
"You can do it," Dad said.

27
00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:36.780
"Fine." Oliver kept playing.

28
00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:41.545
At the last hole, he took a big swing.

29
00:02:41.546 --> 00:02:47.957
The ball dropped into the hole!

30
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:51.582
"A hole in one!" Emmy cried.

31
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:54.800
"You won a free game."

32
00:02:54.801 --> 00:03:00.900
Oliver grinned. "Minigolf is fun!

33
00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:04.733
Let's play again!"

34
00:03:04.734 --> 00:03:08.861
Harry and Emmy groaned.

35
00:03:08.862 --> 00:03:23.297
"Um," Dad said. "Let's get ice cream."

